"00:30.140">hourglass </span><span begin="00:30.140" end="00:30.230">it's </span><span begin="00:30.230" end="00:30.560">ticking </span><span begin="00:30.560" end="00:30.770">like </span><span begin="00:30.770" end="00:30.830">a </span><span begin="00:30.830" end="00:31.280">clock</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.430" end="00:34.100"><span begin="00:31.430" end="00:31.580">It's </span><span begin="00:31.580" end="00:31.640">a </span><span begin="00:31.640" end="00:31.970">matter </span><span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.090">of </span><span begin="00:32.090" end="00:32.510">time </span><span begin="00:32.510" end="00:32.810">before </span><span begin="00:32.810" end="00:33.080">we </span><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.200">all </span><span begin="00:33.200" end="00:33.590">run </span><span begin="00:33.590" end="00:34.100">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.130" end="00:36.500"><span begin="00:34.130" end="00:34.310">When </span><span begin="00:34.310" end="00:34.370">I </span><span begin="00:34.370" end="00:34.640">thought </span><span begin="00:34.640" end="00:34.730">he </span><span begin="00:34.730" end="00:34.910">was </span><span begin="00:34.910" end="00:35.210">mine </span><span begin="00:35.210" end="00:35.390">she </span><span begin="00:35.390" end="00:35.660">caught </span><span begin="00:35.660" end="00:35.780">him </span><span begin="00:35.780" end="00:35.990">by </span><span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.080">the </span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.500">mouth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.620" end="00:38.000"><span begin="00:36.620" end="00:36.800">I </span><span begin="00:36.800" end="00:37.220">waited </span><span begin="00:37.220" end="00:37.400">eight </span><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:37.700">long </span><span begin="00:37.700" end="00:38.000">months</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.000" end="00:39.380"><span begin="00:38.000" end="00:38.180">She </span><span begin="00:38.180" end="00:38.510">finally </span><span begin="00:38.510" end="00:38.840">set </span><span begin="00:38.840" end="00:38.990">him </span><span begin="00:38.990" end="00:39.380">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.410" end="00:42.260"><span begin="00:39.410" end="00:39.530">I </span><span begin="00:39.530" end="00:39.830">told </span><span begin="00:39.830" end="00:39.980">him </span><span begin="00:39.980" end="00:40.130">I </span><span begin="00:40.130" end="00:40.400">couldn't </span><span begin="00:40.400" end="00:40.760">lie </span><span begin="00:40.760" end="00:40.970">he </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.180">was </span><span begin="00:41.180" end="00:41.360">the </span><span begin="00:41.360" end="00:41.630">only </span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:41.840">one </span><span begin="00:41.840" end="00:42.020">for </span><span begin="00:42.020" end="00:42.260">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.260" end="00:44.420"><span begin="00:42.260" end="00:42.350">Two </span><span begin="00:42.350" end="00:42.470">weeks </span><span begin="00:42.470" end="00:42.740">two </span><span begin="00:42.740" end="00:43.010">weeks </span><span begin="00:43.010" end="00:43.100">and </span><span begin="00:43.100" end="00:43.340">we </span><span begin="00:43.340" end="00:43.730">caught </span><span begin="00:43.730" end="00:43.850">on </span><span begin="00:43.850" end="00:44.420">fire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.420" end="00:45.530"><span begin="00:44.420" end="00:44.605">She's </span><span begin="00:44.605" end="00:44.790">got </span><span begin="00:44.790" end="00:44.975">it </span><span begin="00:44.975" end="00:45.160">out </span><span begin="00:45.160" end="00:45.345">for </span><span begin="00:45.345" end="00:45.530">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.530" end="00:47.810"><span begin="00:45.530" end="00:45.680">But </span><span begin="00:45.680" end="00:45.830">I </span><span begin="00:45.830" end="00:46.040">wear </span><span begin="00:46.040" end="00:46.130">the </span><span begin="00:46.130" end="00:46.610">biggest </span><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:47.810">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.540" end="00:54.020"><span begin="00:50.540" end="00:51.830">Whoa </span><span begin="00:51.830" end="00:51.920">I </span><span begin="00:51.920" end="00:52.220">never </span><span begin="00:52.220" end="00:52.520">meant </span><span begin="00:52.520" end="00:52.910">to </span><span begin="00:52.910" end="00:54.020">brag</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.050" end="00:56.180"><span begin="00:54.050" end="00:54.380">But </span><span begin="00:54.380" end="00:54.470">I </span><span begin="00:54.470" end="00:54.770">got </span><span begin="00:54.770" end="00:54.890">him </span><span begin="00:54.890" end="00:55.070">where </span><span begin="00:55.070" end="00:55.160">I </span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.490">want </span><span begin="00:55.490" end="00:55.670">him </span><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:56.180">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.180" end="00:59.690"><span begin="00:56.180" end="00:56.990">Whoa </span><span begin="00:56.990" end="00:57.110">it </span><span begin="00:57.110" end="00:57.290">was </span><span begin="00:57.290" end="00:57.620">never </span><span begin="00:57.620" end="00:57.860">my </span><span begin="00:57.860" end="00:58.370">intention </span><span begin="00:58.370" end="00:58.460">to </span><span begin="00:58.460" end="00:59.690">brag</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.810" end="01:02.150"><span begin="00:59.810" end="00:59.990">To </span><span begin="00:59.990" end="01:00.350">steal </span><span begin="01:00.350" end="01:00.470">it </span><span begin="01:00.470" end="01:00.620">all </span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.950">away </span><span begin="01:00.950" end="01:01.130">from </span><span begin="01:01.130" end="01:01.250">you </span><span begin="01:01.250" end="01:02.150">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.570" end="01:04.970"><s